alue":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T12:50:16-08:00","id":9072,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Eremite</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9053#post9053\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So this will be funded in... minutes? An hour? Only 501 dollars to go, then we see the sweet stretchgoals! C'mon free future pdfs...<br /> <br /> EDIT: And it's funded. In... 5 and a half hours, I think.</div> </div> </div> </div>Three and a half. Which means 40k in under 4 hours... have I mentioned that demons are superstitious about the number 4?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T13:00:36-08:00","id":9075,"title":"","content":"Forgive the stupid questions, but this is the first time I've enough money to afford funding a Kickstarter.<br /> <br /> How payment and shipping exactly work? Kickstarter.com automatically uses the credit card and address of my Amazon account?","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T13:28:44-08:00","id":9103,"title":"","content":"Kickstarter goes through Amazon, so it doesn't receive your credit card number; it just receives the payment from Amazon. Amazon uses the credit card attached to your account with Amazon, <i>but it doesn't actually charge the card until the Kickstarter ends</i> (so in a month). Shipping is I think included in the cost of the pledge tiers, which is why the American pledge tiers are cheaper than the international ones?","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T13:49:24-08:00","id":9132,"title":"","content":"Shipping is indeed included in each of the pledge tiers. After the Kickstarter's run its course, backers will receive a survey to fill out, which is how we collect shipping addresses.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Cavaliers of Mars Creator</b><br /> <b>Retired CofD Lead</b><br /> <br /> Check out my <a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/browse.php?author=Rose%20Bailey\" target=\"_blank\">guides to </a><a href=\"https://www.storytellersvault.com/product/261142/BITE-ME-How-to-Write-Vampire?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">Vampire</a> and my <a href=\"https://www.drivethrurpg.com/browse/pub/4895/Fantasy-Heartbreaker?affiliate_id=453494&amp;src=OPPf\" target=\"_blank\">indie games</a>!","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/2-rose-bailey","name":"Rose Bailey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar2_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Oct 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2361"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T14:42:55-08:00","id":9196,"title":"","content":"... I've already read good chunks of the text preview. It IS pretty much the complete game. For free.<br /> And now you gave it to me for free, I'd feel really, REALLY bad not contributing. (Plus, the art, what's in the quickstart is beautiful).<br /> You magnificent bastards.<br /> You just used Devil's Advocate to reduce piracy, didn't you?<br /> *shakes fist dramatically*","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Part-time table flipper.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/519-chairkicker","name":"ChairKicker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar519_2.png","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"237"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T14:51:24-08:00","id":9205,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ChairKicker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9196#post9196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">... I've already read good chunks of the text preview. It IS pretty much the complete game. For free.<br /> And now you gave it to me for free, I'd feel really, REALLY bad not contributing. (Plus, the art, what's in the quickstart is beautiful).<br /> You magnificent bastards.<br /> You just used Devil's Advocate to reduce piracy, didn't you?<br /> *shakes fist dramatically*</div> </div> </div> </div>I really admire the Onyx Path approach to letting us see and have things for free and relying on trust - it's damn near impossible to stop pdf sharing and piracy so they've moved to a model based on people paying more what they want and relying on trust and gratitude. Which makes me want to them give them my money even more.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T16:08:59-08:00","id":9264,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=8895#post8895\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I had to step down from Glamorous Operative, but for 20 minutes I was gonna be a star!<br /> <br /> Well, I'm comfortable with where I fell.</div> </div> </div> </div>So, that was you, and here I was thinking I was filling the 12th slot and now I'm only number 11.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Egg</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm thinking about doing Glamorous Operative or Inquisitive Demon...all that information would be the bee's knees or it would be pretty stellar to see myself.<br /> <br /> I'm just a regular Unchained now.</div> </div> </div> </div>I'll think I'll stick with my pledge.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> </div> <div class=\"message\">Better make up your mind fast-stuff like Glamorous Operative disappear obscenely fast</div> </div> </div> </div><br /> Yeah, that's why I pledged not long after I was sent a e-mail from <b>Richard Thomas</b> about <b>Demon The Descent - Kick-Starter</b> and I had a look and thought I would pledge later. Much later and then I noticed that 11 out of the 12 slots had already been taken form the <b>Glamorous Operative</b> tier. So I went ahead took the last one.<br /> <br /> Now it's the second last one.<br /> <br /> I need a Backer-Badge to go with the other two.......is anybody making badges?<br /> <br /> BTW, I was previously <b>Wereman</b> on the <b>White-Wolf Studio</b> forums.<br /> <br /> Surprise <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"https://scontent-lax3-1.xx.fbcdn.net/hphotos-xfl1/v/t1.0-9/11999058_1477906402511404_6367649438608181692_n.jpg?oh=70d49fe91b2932b397dc24c5df2764ba&amp;oe=56A3338B\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":1056,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","user":"Wolf-Man","date":". 11-12-2013, 07:30 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1056-wolf-man","name":"Wolf-Man","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1056_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"145"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T17:56:24-08:00","id":9354,"title":"","content":"You know, the stupid part is I wouldn't have this problem if I had just been willing to let go of another ambition.<br /> <br /> Oh well, bringing Wolf Children to my town is satisfying. Not as immortalizing, but satisfying.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T18:19:53-08:00","id":9369,"title":"","content":"Backed at $50 before the goal was steamrolled. Or I read the spoiler script.<br /> <br /> I regret nothing.<br /> <br /> ...Speaking of the spoilers, how about them stigmatics? Even more awesome than I thought they would be, and my expectations were pretty high. You can create a chronicle revolving around them just from rules alone.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T18:25:19-08:00","id":9372,"title":"","content":"One thing I really enjoyed; the Seattle bit, with all the Timelines. The story about Seattle was my favorite part of the GMC, and I almost ran a mortals game based on it. Now with this extra material (Comrade West and the Demon's Republic of Seattle), I'm definitely doing it. Can't wait to see the Seattle book expand on these splinters.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T18:42:25-08:00","id":9387,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Leliel</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9369#post9369\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">...Speaking of the spoilers, how about them stigmatics? Even more awesome than I thought they would be, and my expectations were pretty high. You can create a chronicle revolving around them just from rules alone.</div> </div> </div> </div>Human stigmatics are good. Now, cryptids? Cryptids are more exciting than I expected. David Icke reptilians as janitors and night clerks across the World of Darkness? Yes, please.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T18:43:54-08:00","id":9390,"title":"","content":"I've always wondered about the &quot;99%&quot; of the book they've given for Changing Breeds and now Demon: What's the 1%? Is that just typo fixes and slight rewording, or are they holding back a few little things? WHAT ARE THEY HIDING?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/740-anaximander","name":"Anaximander","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar740_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"241"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T18:52:42-08:00","id":9391,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>atamajakki</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9372#post9372\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">One thing I really enjoyed; the Seattle bit, with all the Timelines. The story about Seattle was my favorite part of the GMC, and I almost ran a mortals game based on it. Now with this extra material (Comrade West and the Demon's Republic of Seattle), I'm definitely doing it. Can't wait to see the Seattle book expand on these splinters.</div> </div> </div> </div>You know what's so awesome about this? I've been running a collection of Chronicles called the Seattle Chronicles that are a collection of chronicles by each of the game lines in the area (the area meaning (usually) western Wa, so still spread out) so that my troupe and I can play around an area that we are very familiar with being locales.<br /> <br /> The Seattle book will literally be a godsend for me Seattle: The Descent game!","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://www.kickstarter.com/projects/200664283/demon-the-descent-prestige-edition\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://img513.imageshack.us/img513/4478/8vno.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a><br /> Frequent Story Teller for the Circle of Five gaming group.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/654-xiongrey","name":"xiongrey","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar654_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"549"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T20:09:34-08:00","id":9430,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Stupid Loserman</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9387#post9387\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> Human stigmatics are good. Now, cryptids? Cryptids are more exciting than I expected. David Icke reptilians as janitors and night clerks across the World of Darkness? Yes, please.</div> </div> </div> </div>Even better? Both cryptids are nice.<br /> <br /> We have the hidden reptilian spies running at the sight of a particularly menacing spider, and mothmen who are more interesting in eating squirrels than foretelling doom (I can just see a demon who wants one for a pet, waving a dead mouse at it while whistling).","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://imageshack.us/a/img824/1346/mosz.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" />","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/180-leliel","name":"Leliel","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar180_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"2259"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-12T22:03:01-08:00","id":9462,"title":"","content":"Well Shit. I haven't read through the entire thing all the way, but I think Demon just became my second favorite WoD game.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T00:35:18-08:00","id":9524,"title":"","content":"I'ma get me a purdy book.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"https://docs.google.com/document/d/1Cxuog44JenzbN7GaAyRqDO4DXce9VGv6ybaCv9yYsPk/edit?usp=sharing\" target=\"_blank\">Simulacre: An Alternative Morality Stat for Prometheans</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/promethean-the-created-aa/9523-the-alchemy-lab-homebrew-athanors\" target=\"_blank\">Homebrew Athanors</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/887-metamurpho","name":"Metamurpho","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar887_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"228"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T02:34:15-08:00","id":9541,"title":"","content":"I have to admit the WIP link took my by complete surprise (with the latest news regarding the PDF which said that it won't come out until mid / late december [aka after KS] ruined my day<br /> and made me quite unhappy, but the preview mended this quite quickly <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).<br /> <br /> I think that is the first time I have seen such a thing in place and when I take into account what I'm reading from ppl (and also my own reaction to that) good job with the surprise and a very nice idea there onyxpath ppl!<br /> <br /> Still looking throught he pledges to ee which one is best for me (thought I found a good fitting one until I got it that each pledge (benefit) isn't cummulative but instead stands on its own)","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T03:18:19-08:00","id":9558,"title":"","content":"So:<br /> <br /> It seems I have a new favorite game. It fits that's the first one I'm able to fund.<br /> <br /> Congratulations to the devs and the artists: the book's great, the best core in years. I liked Geist and Mummy but, I'll admit, I personally feel Demon's core is substantially better in comparison.<br /> <br /> I can't wait to get my fancy Prestige Book <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/cool.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Cool\" smilieid=\"6\" class=\"inlineimg\" />","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/815620-cinder-s-comprehensive-collection-of-creations\" target=\"_blank\">Cinder's Comprehensive Collection of Creations</a> - Homebrew Hub<br /> <br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/beast-the-primordial-aa/1172470-cinder-writes-about-beast-the-primordial\" target=\"_blank\">I write about Beast: The Primordial a lot</a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/38-cinder","name":"Cinder","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar38_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1408"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T03:26:15-08:00","id":9561,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9541#post9541\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I have to admit the WIP link took my by complete surprise (with the latest news regarding the PDF which said that it won't come out until mid / late december [aka after KS] ruined my day and made me quite unhappy, but the preview mended this quite quickly <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /> ).</div> </div> </div> </div>This is mostly a response to a lot of the flak they've gotten for the delays with past Kickstarters. By setting the estimates much farther out, it gives them way more room to have a snag in the process and still meet the estimate.<br /> <br /> <div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> I think that is the first time I have seen such a thing in place and when I take into account what I'm reading from ppl (and also my own reaction to that) good job with the surprise and a very nice idea there onyxpath ppl! </div> </div> </div>They did the same with W20 Changing Breeds (though stretch goals added a good deal of content after that), and some of the past books have had a large amount of the material available via the dev blogs.<br /> <br /> That said, yeah, it is pretty sweet to see how close it really is to done.<br />","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/617-heavy-arms","name":"Heavy Arms","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar617_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"12634"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T03:32:25-08:00","id":9564,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> This is mostly a response to a lot of the flak they've gotten for the delays with past Kickstarters. By setting the estimates much farther out, it gives them way more room to have a snag in the process and still meet the estimate. </div> </div> </div>All other companies I know don't do anything to mend those critiques so a nice surprise there from Onyxpaths side.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T04:12:26-08:00","id":9578,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Anaximander</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9390#post9390\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've always wondered about the &quot;99%&quot; of the book they've given for Changing Breeds and now Demon: What's the 1%? Is that just typo fixes and slight rewording, or are they holding back a few little things? WHAT ARE THEY HIDING?! <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/smile.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Smile\" smilieid=\"1\" class=\"inlineimg\" /></div> </div> </div> </div>Yeah, basically. It's 99% done, meaning that the content is done, we just might tweak things as mistakes come to light.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/13-blackhatmatt","name":"blackhatmatt","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar13_2.jpeg","title":"Banned","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"464"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T05:04:05-08:00","id":9596,"title":"","content":"I'm still Mummy's #1 fan (at least, that's what I tell myself) but I'm really, really glad that they're doing everything right with Demon now: previewing the core rules so people know what they're buying, a write-up of the US signature setting, some discussion about crossover with the other splats, and the writers and developers engaging the audience more. Also not KSing it over Christmas.<br /> <br /> But seriously. This is why Onyx Path came around: the times are a'changing, and they know it. Here, have the game for free and STILL had the goal funded in a couple of hours. You guys trust us and we trust you","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T08:04:08-08:00","id":9694,"title":"","content":"I've donated for two books. I see we reached a new goal. What's a seed? I swear if it's another PDF I'm retracting my donation.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1064-miss_minty","name":"miss_minty","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"283"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T08:27:01-08:00","id":9712,"title":"","content":"What 's the issue with a PDF? You make it sound like the stretch goals mitigate the value of the original product.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T12:44:21-08:00","id":9919,"title":"","content":"Oh man, guys, this is the quickest I've ever gotten a top ten list for music. I'll start a soundtrack thread later.<br /> <br /> (My top tens tend to be more like a couple hours worth of songs. Speaking of which, gotta recover my Changeling Top Ten[if not rewrite it] and put up Hunter's)","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T12:55:47-08:00","id":9927,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>miss_minty</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9694#post9694\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I've donated for two books. I see we reached a new goal. What's a seed? I swear if it's another PDF I'm retracting my donation.</div> </div> </div> </div>From what I gather adventure seeds","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T13:02:14-08:00","id":9933,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>Ryu</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9927#post9927\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\"><br /> From what I gather adventure seeds</div> </div> </div> </div>Specifically in the style used in the God-Machine Chronicle book, which features a breakdown on the mystery, the truth behind it, what sort of player characters are suitable for the adventure, a layout of interacting with the mystery, a list of failure conditions and goals for the player characters, some sample suitable dice rolls and traits, and how the seed can escalate into other adventures.<br /> <br /> I hope either the seeds are substantially longer than the ones in the GMC book or &quot;seed #1&quot; is actually a few separate adventure write-ups, though, because they're pretty short in the GMC book, not long enough to really sustain individual stretch goals unless they're really frequent goals.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/522-stupid-loserman","name":"Stupid Loserman","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar522_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1824"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T13:04:53-08:00","id":9935,"title":"","content":"from what I understood a whole book of seeds but lets see","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/914-ryu","name":"Ryu","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"330"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T14:44:43-08:00","id":9993,"title":"","content":"So I've been wanting really badly to love Demon: the Descent. I've been having this idea that if DtD became all it could be, it could challenge VtR as my favourite WoD game.<br /> <br /> I've also been worried that it might not happen. That the focus on &quot;techgnostic espionage&quot; took precedence over being a game about demons doing demony things.<br /> <br /> One of these things happened after reading a lot of the free &quot;preview&quot;. Another did not.<br /> <br /> Suffice it to say that the text of the book leaves me with the distinct impression that this game? This is the fully legitimate child of Changeling: the Lost and Werewolf: the Apocalypse (yes, Apocalypse). And I motherfucking love the living shit out of it.<br /> <br /> Throw your money at this thing. I know I did.<br /> <br /> Now to find someone to play with...<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wEyl4jj.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":508,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","user":"sikker","date":". 11-13-2013, 05:47 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T16:50:47-08:00","id":10078,"title":"","content":"I was initially skeptic of Demon: the Descent as well, but realizing that you're playing a fallen angel, even if it is a techgnostic spy game, helped sell me. Seeing exploits like Raise Dead or Hellfire makes me feel even better, knowing that, again even if it is a techgnostic spy game (which, I mean, was never a bad concept), you're still playing fucking DEMONS","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/638-reseru","name":"reseru","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar638_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"1574"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T18:03:30-08:00","id":10108,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>sikker</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=9993#post9993\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">So I've been wanting really badly to love Demon: the Descent. I've been having this idea that if DtD became all it could be, it could challenge VtR as my favourite WoD game.<br /> <br /> I've also been worried that it might not happen. That the focus on &quot;techgnostic espionage&quot; took precedence over being a game about demons doing demony things.<br /> <br /> One of these things happened after reading a lot of the free &quot;preview&quot;. Another did not.<br /> <br /> Suffice it to say that the text of the book leaves me with the distinct impression that this game? This is the fully legitimate child of Changeling: the Lost and Werewolf: the Apocalypse (yes, Apocalypse). And I motherfucking love the living shit out of it.<br /> <br /> Throw your money at this thing. I know I did.<br /> <br /> Now to find someone to play with...<br /> <img src=\"http://i.imgur.com/wEyl4jj.gif\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/></div> </div> </div> </div>This ALMOST made me want to say Changeling took a step down from first. Ultimately there are themes I like better with Changeling, but Demon does so many things right it's hard not to love it. And yeah I can see what Apocalypse elements you're getting at and I kind of have to agree.<br /> <br /> This game might be the pinnacle of the World of Darkness for a really long time, having learned all the lessons and committing barest of flaws. I'm curious if it can actually be topped.<br /> <br /> PS: Oh yeah, I'll totally play this with you if you want, Sikker.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":2}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T18:28:38-08:00","id":10116,"title":"","content":"I've been reading through the pdf. Man, there's some real love for conspiracies in here. We've got the aforementioned Reptillains, Mothmen and attendant Men in Black, a world where Y2K happened...<br /> <br /> Actually, how awesome is the face we have two Y2Ks - the diligent angel and the timelocked demon? I've never been that interested in playing in the default cities of WoD games mostly because they're all in America and I'm in England, but Seattle with its splintered timelines might just be interesting enough..,<br /> <br /> Also, a question. The 'Seed reward (which we'll probably have achieved by the time I return to this thread) and the unlocked Seattle book... will these be available free to backers of a certain level (like all the pdf goodies for the Mummy Kickstarter)? I may have missed it, but it doesn't seem to confirm this anywhere...","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><i>Onyx Path Freelancer: Demon Storyteller's Guide, Dark Eras, Night Horrors: Enemy Action</i><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/825063-storyteller-s-guide-extra-material\" target=\"_blank\">Storyteller's Guide Extra Material</a><br /> <a href=\"http://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/899423-after-the-fall-bonus-material\" target=\"_blank\">After the Fall: Bonus Material</a>","edited":{"userid":452,"user_link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","user":"Eremite","date":". 11-13-2013, 09:31 PM"},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/452-eremite","name":"Eremite","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar452_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"355"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T19:10:09-08:00","id":10127,"title":"","content":"The preview has me super excited for the chronicler's guide. I'm just beginning to have mad visions of a motley of changelings on the run through time because the bridge-burners had no idea that they just destroyed an infrastructure's linchpin... (check the time travel section if you no idea what I'm talking about...) <img src=\"http://theonyxpath.com/forum/core/images/smilies/biggrin.png\" class=\"bbcode-attachment bbcode-attachment--lightbox js-lightbox\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" itemprop=\"image\" loading=\"lazy\"/>","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[{"type":"\ud83d\udc4d","count":1}],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/885-bwgustaf","name":"bwgustaf","avatar":"data:image/svg+xml;base64,","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"107"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T19:43:08-08:00","id":10141,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>reseru</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=10078#post10078\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I was initially skeptic of Demon: the Descent as well, but realizing that you're playing a fallen angel, even if it is a techgnostic spy game, helped sell me. Seeing exploits like Raise Dead or Hellfire makes me feel even better, knowing that, again even if it is a techgnostic spy game (which, I mean, was never a bad concept), you're still playing fucking DEMONS</div> </div> </div> </div>I was skeptical too, until I played it. The Wrecking Crew really showed me how much AWESOME this game is.<br /> Thanks for busting my wallet Mr. Martin <img src=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/images/smilies/wink.png\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" title=\"Wink\" smilieid=\"4\" class=\"inlineimg\" /><br /> <br /> addendum: I plan on running this at local cons. I really want to show new players the potential for great storytelling that Demon offers.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Assistant Organizer for:</b><br /> <a href=\"http://www.meetup.com/Dead-Gamers-Society/\" target=\"_blank\"><img itemprop=\"image\" class=\"bbcode-attachment\" src=\"http://i162.photobucket.com/albums/t261/jlburgos_bucket/a41e98d1-1eed-4506-a8d2-2b3bea4a43da_zps469395ad.jpg\" border=\"0\" alt=\"\" /></a>","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/311-joeb","name":"JoeB","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar311_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"198"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T19:45:01-08:00","id":10145,"title":"","content":"I'm in love with the Deva Corporation. You can never have enough corporate espionage for me.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/>Remi. she/her. game designer.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/281-atamajakki","name":"atamajakki","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar281_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"5487"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T20:30:35-08:00","id":10163,"title":"","content":"I absolutely love how they handle pacts. There is an actual reason to steal people's souls!","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/1092-tribute-of-a-dark-heart","name":"Tribute of a Dark Heart","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar1092_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"42"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-13T21:58:23-08:00","id":10196,"title":"","content":"I'm fairly convinced this book was actually written by demons as a way to achieve Hell.*<br /> <br /> *by which I mean it's thoroughly engrossing and awesome, not that I actually believe this is true, because that would be silly.","signature":"<hr class=\"b-divider\"/><br/><b>Kelly R.S. Steele, Freelance Writer(Feel free to call me Kelly, Arcane, or Arc)</b><br /> The world is not beautiful, therefore it is.-Keiichi Sigsawa, Kino's Journey<br /> Feminine pronouns, please.","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/99-arcanearts","name":"ArcaneArts","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar99_2.png","title":"Member","rank":5,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"11384"}]},"thankedby":[]},{"date":"2013-11-14T07:48:02-08:00","id":10405,"title":"","content":"<div class=\"bbcode_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote\"> <div class=\"quote_container\"> <div class=\"bbcode_quote_container b-icon b-icon__ldquo-l--gray\"></div> <div class=\"bbcode_postedby\"> Originally posted by <strong>ArcaneArts</strong> <a href=\"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/forum/main-category/main-forum/the-new-world-of-darkness/demon-the-descent/8856-kickstarter-is-up?p=10196#post10196\" rel=\"nofollow\" title=\"View Post\" class=\"b-icon b-icon__double-arrow-right--blue animate-scroll\">View Post</a> </div> <div class=\"message\">I'm fairly convinced this book was actually written by demons as a way to achieve Hell.*<br /> <br /> *by which I mean it's thoroughly engrossing and awesome, not that I actually believe this is true, because that would be silly.</div> </div> </div> </div>Something I think would be supercool was that if the Demon corebook was a fabrication made by the God-Machine. Misinformation. Counter-intelligence.<br /> <br /> And that each of the supplements were accounts made by actual Demons to challenge the lies and slander of the corebook.","signature":"","edited":{"userid":0,"user_link":"","user":"","date":""},"attachments":[],"reactions":[],"user":{"link":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/member/508-sikker","name":"sikker","avatar":"https://forum.theonyxpath.com/core/avatars/0/0/6/0/4/5/avatar508_2.jpeg","title":"Member","rank":0,"rank-name":"","custom":[{"key":"Join Date:","value":"Nov 2013"},{"key":"Posts:","value":"101"}]},"thankedby":[]}]}